<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's TCV 2008 bond yields 6.7578 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's TCV 2008 bond yields 6.7578 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corp of Victoria (TCV) said the tender of its 7.5 percent August 2008 stock produced an weighted average yield (WAY) of 6.7578 percent.</p>
<p> OFFERED A$100 MLN     COUPON    7.5 PCT    MATURITY  15.08.08</p>
<p> TYPE    SEMI/GOVT     WAY	 6.7578     SETT DATE 24.07.97</p>
<p> ALLOTTED A$100 MLN    RANGE     6.755-6.760</p>
<p>TCV is the central borrowing authority for the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
